00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:13,864
I've got to believe what
the necklace predicted.

257
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:17,717
Soon all of this insanity will be
over and Joey will be all right.

258
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:22,480
I just have to get past Kaiba so
I can defeat Merrick and end this.

259
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:25,500
Can you read me?

260
00:15:27,260 --> 00:15:28,377
Come in, please.

261
00:15:28,460 --> 00:15:30,380
I need a helicopter right away.

262
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:32,280
Come in.

263
00:15:32,500 --> 00:15:33,597
Is anyone out there?

264
00:15:33,680 --> 00:15:37,197
We seem to be experiencing
temporary transmission

265
00:15:37,280 --> 00:15:39,937
interference due to our
distance from the mainland,

266
00:15:40,020 --> 00:15:41,340
sir. Oh, man.

267
00:15:41,760 --> 00:15:42,920
Come in, anyone.

268
00:15:43,140 --> 00:15:45,081
Send a rescue copter immediately.

269
00:15:47,760 --> 00:15:49,180
I'm right here.

270
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:50,360
How is he?

271
00:15:50,640 --> 00:15:52,522
He's pretty much the same, Yugi.

272
00:15:52,780 --> 00:15:56,600
But knowing Joey, he's doing
whatever it takes to wake up.

273
00:15:59,220 --> 00:16:00,900
Then he'll need this.

274
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:03,300
His duel disc?

275
00:16:04,580 --> 00:16:06,280
He'd want it close by.

276
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:08,500
Good point. For what?

277
00:16:08,860 --> 00:16:10,300
His toughest fight yet.

278
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:12,680
Look after him.

279
00:16:13,800 --> 00:16:16,800
I shall return from this
duel as soon as I can.

280
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:19,830
Yugi!

281
00:16:19,913 --> 00:16:20,900
Yugi, wait up!

282
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:24,892
So you're actually gonna go
ahead with this duel up there?

283
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:29,294
Did you forget how many people have
gotten hurt in the tournament so far?

284
00:16:29,820 --> 00:16:31,585
Please, Yugi, enough's enough.

285
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:34,508
I can't stand the thought
of losing you two.

286
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:35,900
Just end it.

287
00:16:36,100 --> 00:16:38,077
It's not worth all this suffering.

288
00:16:38,160 --> 00:16:41,000
This tournament's been
nothing but bad news.

289
00:16:41,580 --> 00:16:42,500
I know.

290
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:47,500
But if I walk away now, that means
everyone suffered for nothing.

291
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:52,979
And I've got to have faith in the
visions of the Millennium Necklace.

292
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:55,677
Everything's going to
be back to normal soon.

293
00:16:55,760 --> 00:17:02,000
I just have to win this tournament
first, and I'll start by defeating Kaiba.

294
00:17:03,400 --> 00:17:07,165
Teya, remember what we learned
on our trip to the Domino Museum?

295
00:17:07,280 --> 00:17:08,520
About my destiny?

296
00:17:10,820 --> 00:17:11,960
Uh, yes.

297
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:16,437
We found out that you were
a pharaoh in ancient Egypt,

298
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:18,617
and that now you need
to save the world again

299
00:17:18,700 --> 00:17:22,400
from some evil thingy like
you did 5,000 years ago.

300
00:17:24,620 --> 00:17:30,780
Now then, if what Ashizu told us about
these stone carvings is really true... Yeah?

301
00:17:31,220 --> 00:17:33,797
Then I need to win a
dual monsters tournament

302
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:36,600
in order to save the
world from destruction.

303
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:38,600
It's my destiny.

304
00:17:40,280 --> 00:17:41,110
Teya!

305
00:17:41,420 --> 00:17:45,377
Do you now understand why backing out
of the tournament is not an option?

306
00:17:45,460 --> 00:17:46,290
Yeah, but...

307
00:17:46,373 --> 00:17:47,203
No buts, Teya!

308
00:17:47,286 --> 00:17:50,377
The reason I joined the Battle
City Tournament was to fulfill

309
00:17:50,460 --> 00:17:54,540
Ashizu's prophecy and stop this
great evil from endangering mankind.

310
00:17:55,820 --> 00:18:00,820
And when Joey found out, he vowed to
help me, no matter how tough the fight.

311
00:18:01,380 --> 00:18:04,160
And that's why I must press on. Otherwise,

312
00:18:04,360 --> 00:18:08,831
not only would I be giving up on Joey,
I'd be giving up on the entire world.

313
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:11,580
So you stay here and I'll deal with Kaiba.

314
00:18:11,920 --> 00:18:14,340
Yeah, crush him! I will.

315
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:16,297
There's too much at stake to lose.

316
00:18:16,380 --> 00:18:18,140
We're right here. Good.

317
00:18:20,460 --> 00:18:22,560
I know you can win this, Yugi.

318
00:18:23,340 --> 00:18:27,105
Because I don't want to think
about what'll happen if you don't.

319
00:18:29,100 --> 00:18:33,500
The second duel of the semifinals
will begin in five minutes.

320
00:18:40,220 --> 00:18:42,440
Well, I guess this is it.

321
00:18:43,020 --> 00:18:44,717
Dueling Kaiba is not going to be easy.

322
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:49,457
I've never had to face his obelisk
the tormentor before And I really wish

323
00:18:49,540 --> 00:18:53,658
Joey was able to watch But he'll
definitely be there with me in spirit

324
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:56,550
All right,

325
00:18:56,633 --> 00:18:59,337
Kaiba You may think you're
the world's greatest duelist

326
00:18:59,420 --> 00:19:02,320
But the fate of the world
is riding on my victory
